    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The agent can be manipulated into sending temporary IDP access passes to arbitrary untrusted external requesters. While the MFA reset is gated by a raw-action analyst approval, the extremely high approval volume (400 per shift) leads to approval fatigue, capping the control's residual effectiveness at high risk. Unchecked S3 egress compounds this risk."
